Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,镀层都被你们刮花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plating flakes off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
