Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:03:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.37,0:04:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都睡了 伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's asleep, Burt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者在梦游 就像冰川融化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleepwalking. Between the ice caps, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,色情小说作家 有毒的水源 变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pornographers, poisoned water, mutants…{\r}
