Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:05:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 克莱德 都已经2029年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Clyde. It's 2029.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们还要提起变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we still talking about mutants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 我在车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's me. I'm in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 旅途很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was a good trip.{\r}
