Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,美利坚 美利坚 美利坚\N{\fnArial\fs30}USA! USA! USA!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,美利坚 美利坚 美利坚\N{\fnArial\fs30}USA! USA! USA! USA!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,金刚狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wolverine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 - 请别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, fuck. - Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有事相求\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in trouble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是唯一能帮我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one that could help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多远给我滚多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the fuck away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.01,0:06:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道哪儿来的疯女人 不必担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, some crazy lady. Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是百闻不如一见 金刚狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I live and breathe, the Wolverine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.19,0:07:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜他成了瘾君子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's a junkie now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你车门上怎么有弹孔啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you got some buckshot in your door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.53,0:07:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你在凤凰城\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you was in Phoenix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,可昨晚 我德州的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, last night, some friends of mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,打来电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Texas HP called…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,说在54号公路旁的水塘里发现3具墨西哥人的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and told me they found three dead cholos in a pullout on 54.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很平常 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unusual, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有具少了只手 还有具少了条腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except one was missing a hand, another one a leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让他们觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they was thinking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:54.72,Title,0,0,0,0,,可能是脱逃的老虎 或者《猛鬼街》里的佛瑞迪干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was either an escaped tiger or Freddy Krueger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.51,0:07:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们不可能会开车啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But neither one of them can drive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.47,0:08:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个是电影虚构的 另一个已经灭绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one being fictional, the other one extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.64,0:08:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们找到的车轮防滑钉是克赖斯勒上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since the wheel lugs theyfound belonged to a '24 Chrysler…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开的就是克赖斯勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a '24 Chrysler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她找到你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She found you yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,加芙列拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriela?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}See…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找的不是你 狼叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not looking for you, Wolvie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,确切的说 我要找的人恰巧在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not really. I'm looking for someone who's looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她趁我不注意时带走了我的一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took something of mine when I wasn't looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样我要担责任的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something for which lam responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.26,0:08:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个墨西哥女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mexican lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她正在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has her sights on you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想起什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't ring any bells?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.39,0:08:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识什么加芙列拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know any Gabriela, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以赶紧给我滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}so get the fuck out of my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你把谁藏了起来 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're hiding, amigo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把老光头藏在了墨西哥边境\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old cue ball south of the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想你合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little co-operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点忘了 你是我的偶像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fan, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck, fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 爱斯佩兰萨先生 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mr. Esperanza, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.81,0:09:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是说好六月 可我现在就需要那艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I said June, but I need the boat now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这样就得涨价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would that mean the price go up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.81,0:09:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想要7万\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you wanted 70…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果我能一次性给你4万5现金呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what if I could put together $45, 000 cash right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.63,0:10:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道您有那样内心的美德 勃鲁托斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I know that virtue to be in you, Brutus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.55,0:10:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,正像我知道您的外貌一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}"As well as I do know your outward favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.22,0:10:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 光荣正是我的谈话的题目\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Well, honor is the subject of my story."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今天情况不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's having a bad day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪天情况好过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all bad days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个小时前他就该服药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needed these six hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这些根本不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not enough, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.81,0:10:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一星期都撑不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't see us through the week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.36,0:10:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都折腾了一晚上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a rough night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事 他昨晚和我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other news, he told me last night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在和某个人神交\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's communicating with someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.83,0:11:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人和他神交\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not talking to anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,话别说那么绝对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还交代了很多细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got all these details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为那个蓄水箱能把他隔绝起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that tank was supposed to act as a barrier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他发作起来根本不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got them cracks in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你消停会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没在听我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又开始不停地问问题了 问为什么我们会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been asking questions again about why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他还想钻进我的意识里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's trying to read my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们才要给他喂药\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what these are for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正吃着奶油点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eating his curds and whey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一只大蜘蛛出现 坐在了她的旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then came a big spider Which sat down beside her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.45,0:11:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓了玛菲特小姐一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}And frightened Miss Muffet…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们 我有个好消息要告诉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends, I have good news for you today!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.43,0:12:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做什么并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about what you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么也不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about your deeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只是无法按照\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't live up to God's rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝的旨意而活 没关系 我们并非完人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows that you can't. It's okay, we're imperfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让一下 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said make way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自塔可钟快餐店的新墨西哥鸡肉卷\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new Quesalupa from Taco Bell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,加一份鸡肉 加一份牛排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it with chicken! Get it with steak!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有包裹着浓郁芝士在火上慢烤的饼皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with the cheese baked right in the shell…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,新一季的明星产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the next big thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.95,0:12:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不快来抢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now while supplies last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是那个总让我睡觉的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the man who puts me to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都需要睡会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both could use some sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想对我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我待在这儿多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:13:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember what they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,打针可以缓解痉挛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shots mellow the seizures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.59,0:14:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,按时吃药就不会发作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pills keep them from happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你吹口仙气 愿上帝保佑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you blow on them to make them safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你想起来我是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you remember who I am now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是有的时候没认出来而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just sometimes I don't recognize you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.73,0:14:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快吃药吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the pills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我一个人丢给那个有白化病的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave me alone with that fucking albino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本不听我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一看就知道他们是新的物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a damn speciation when I see one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.58,0:14:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的物种 新的变种人 很年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speciation. New mutant, a young one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,有势力想要屠杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are forces trying to kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.79,0:14:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,势力 他们需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forces? They want help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,势力 势力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forces, forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你已经退出历史舞台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too bad you're not in that business anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要的不是我 而是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't want me, they want you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他们还真是愚不可及\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, that's how fucking stupid they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在自由女神像那儿等着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're waiting for you at the Statue of Liberty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.31,0:14:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由女神像早就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Statue of Liberty was a long time ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 都已经多少年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,早就没有新的变种人了 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no new mutants. Understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.32,0:15:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有25年没有新的变种人出生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasn't been a new one born in 25 years. Not anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.65,0:15:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always thought…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.07,0:15:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是上帝计划的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were part of God's plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者我们是上帝犯下的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we were God's mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太让我失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a disappointment you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年我找到你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I found you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还只是个做困兽之斗的拳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were pursuing a career as a cage fighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对于杀手来说已经是个不错的归宿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A warm capper to a life as an assassin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠嗑药为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hooked on barbiturates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.11,0:15:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时的你就是个野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们接纳了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we took you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,给了你一个温馨的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're gone now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:15:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答我 为什么我们会在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer me! Why are we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.63,0:16:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我该过的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one should live like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这破水箱里被药物麻痹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drugged in a fucking tank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for your own good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.35,0:16:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在等我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're waiting for me to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna fight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有些事情总得商量着解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's things we need to discuss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.71,0:18:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你别嫌我唠叨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, would it be considered nagging…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前就已经和你说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I was to repeat my previous observation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些剂量太少了 没法抑制他的痉挛\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the dose is too low to suppress the seizures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.51,0:18:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙就给我这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what the guy gave me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.43,0:18:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没什么资格讨价还价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't in a position to make demands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早我差点就死在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost died this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 每次他一发作 - 连一分钟都没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That seizure was… - it was barely a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉根本不止一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt a lot longer than a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.66,0:18:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都无法呼吸了 你受到的影响比我小\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't breathe. You're less affected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道该增加剂量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he needs a higher dose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.69,0:18:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道你藏了不少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know you got more money squirreled away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些钱是用来带我们离开这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That money's to get us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.95,0:18:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是我们 是你和他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not us. You and him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.87,0:18:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想买一艘「逐日号」游艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saving to buy a Sunseeker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「日」字是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sun" is the keyword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.16,0:18:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得自己能像不死僵尸那样一辈子躲在船舱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hardly see myself cowering below decks like Nosferatu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那儿迭着你的短裤 给他做葡萄干布丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folding your underpants, and making him spotted dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:18:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你口袋里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found this in your pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.81,0:19:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾德曼合金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adamantium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.55,0:19:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想让自己的脑袋开花\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are planning to blow your brains out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,请到了公海再动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}could you wait till you're out on the high seas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.18,0:19:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚把地板拖干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just mopped these floors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和我说这些废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一年前 你找我来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year ago, you asked me to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And God knows Pvetfled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.08,0:19:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可如果你不肯对我说出实情的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't help you, Logan, not really…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.66,0:19:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我没法帮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're not going to talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚上总是不睡觉 我能听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you at night. You're not sleeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想和我谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna talk about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你喝酒的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the booze you're drinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.43,0:19:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有手指间被你擦掉的脓水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the pus you're wiping away from your knuckles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我洗衣服时看到的血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the blood I wash from your clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者你胸口上的新伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the fresh wounds in your chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些没有愈合的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones that aren't healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及我很肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm pretty sure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.61,0:19:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经看不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't wanna talk about the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓶子上的标签了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you can't read the label on that bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:19:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写的是布洛芬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says, "ibuprofen."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.61,0:20:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我最喜欢的马克杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my favorite mug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.28,0:20:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你多管闲事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of my shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你出问题了 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's happening to you, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.91,0:20:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的体内 你病了 我闻得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the inside you're sick. I can smell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.88,0:20:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我最嗨的一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best night ever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 司机大叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.51,0:21:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.01,0:21:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我们需要搭车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. We need a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没空 叫出租车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not available. Call a cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫加芙列拉·洛佩兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Gabriela Lopez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想知道 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna know your name, lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.18,0:21:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在追杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are men after us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,往北走 去加拿大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go north, cross to Canada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这活儿谁都能干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone can do that job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你5万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you $50, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.90,0:22:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.23,0:22:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带给我的麻烦已经够多的了女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you are fucking up my life, lady!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.03,0:22:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,追你们的那帮人现在盯上我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people after you, they're on my ass now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被人认出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sightings were posted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 到里面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura, go inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.87,0:22:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,被谁认出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sightings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说看到一个长得很像金刚狼的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People said someone who looked like the Wolverine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.99,0:22:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在厄尔巴索当司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}was in El Paso, driving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.16,0:22:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说他看上去老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he looked old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.17,0:22:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过你别再玩那个球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to stop it with that ball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.25,0:22:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这个臭丫头 - 不 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bad girl! - No, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我警告过你 臭丫头 - 不 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I told you, bad girl! - No, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.26,0:22:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可得赔钱给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mamacita's gonna have to pay for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.38,0:22:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, please. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.64,0:22:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们得赔偿我的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna have to pay for damages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.93,0:22:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身上有钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she has cash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.56,0:22:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着你的肥臀滚回你的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get your fat ass back in your office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会赔你钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.36,0:22:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让她打给任何人了 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let her call anyone, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.53,0:22:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会找到我们的 然后杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They Will find us. They Will kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:22:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是名护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a nurse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是 在墨西哥城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was. In Mexico City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.29,0:23:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did that happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.63,0:23:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上 在边界处\N{\fnArial\fs30}This morning. Near the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逃了出来 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got away from them, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.94,0:23:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们认得我的车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they know my car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.98,0:23:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.56,0:23:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait. Please. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.11,0:23:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, wait! Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 你拿着 这里是2万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Here, take this. It's $20, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.74,0:23:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着 带我们去上面的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Take us to this address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你到了那儿我再给你3万\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have $30, 000 more when we get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.49,0:23:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友到时候会给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friends there will give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.12,0:23:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么他们都会给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will give you anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.13,0:23:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些钱哪儿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.46,0:23:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我男朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.76,0:23:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要杀了我 然后带走她\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to kill me and take her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.47,0:23:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's your daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.69,0:24:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're still good inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会帮我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you want to help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.52,0:24:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.61,0:24:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 如果现在就走的话 不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise, there will be no problems if we leave now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能就这么离开去北达科他州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just leave to North Dakota!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.11,0:24:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须周五前赶到那儿 - 否则怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to be there Friday. - Or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.93,0:24:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们就没法过境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or we miss our chance to cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.95,0:24:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我们 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.71,0:24:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.34,0:24:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的老花镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ifikethose. Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.22,0:24:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样看上去年轻点\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make you look younger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.39,0:24:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 听着 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.60,0:24:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能要离开几天 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go away for a few days, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.77,0:24:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得跑趟长途挣笔大钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a long ride for some good money…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.57,0:24:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来后我们就离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when I get back, we're gonna get outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.07,0:24:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开车去叶莱巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna drive down to Yelapa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.61,0:24:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再买艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get ourselves a boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.41,0:24:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此就住在海上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna go live on the ocean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.07,0:24:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那儿就会安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you be safe there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 当然 我们会安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We'll be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.71,0:25:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看罗根给我们带了什么 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what Logan got us, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.71,0:25:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,过几天就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be back in a few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.13,0:25:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.62,0:26:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗根 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Logan. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.17,0:26:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did something go wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.04,0:26:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这活儿一开始就是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}The job was wrong to begin with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.03,0:26:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:26:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.66,0:27:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.33,0:27:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西是谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does this belong to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.37,0:27:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.55,0:27:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没能预见这破事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you were supposed to see shit coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.22,0:27:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以追踪变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can track mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.55,0:27:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能嗅出很多东西 可我不是千里眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a glorified truffle pig, not a clairvoyant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.72,0:27:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到里面去 别让查尔斯出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go inside and keep Charles quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.51,0:27:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,到里面去 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go inside now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.11,0:27:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,调头出去 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to turn around, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.07,0:27:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是私人领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is private property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.23,0:27:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.40,0:27:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我记得这里应该属于\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I believe it belongs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.03,0:27:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家总部在上海的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a multinational smelting company…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.74,0:27:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跨国冶炼公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}based in Shanghai.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.74,0:27:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把老家伙藏哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you keeping the old man? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.12,0:27:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.25,0:27:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is he there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.59,0:27:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,点子不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.09,0:27:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to meet him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.55,0:28:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说国土安全局已经把他的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm told the HSA classifies his brain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.26,0:28:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,列为大规模杀伤性武器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a weapon of mass destruction now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.76,0:28:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在东部发生的事真是可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn shame, what happened back east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.22,0:28:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经死了一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been dead for a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要那女孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.23,0:28:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么女孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.44,0:28:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手里那只球的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that goes along with that ball you're holding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.07,0:28:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有女孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no girl here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.78,0:28:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你去过那家汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you went to the motel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.61,0:28:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 有人订了车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was called there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.99,0:28:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有女孩儿 只有一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no girl. it was just the woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.07,0:28:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个女人 说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the woman. Such as she was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.45,0:28:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你见过加芙列拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you saw Gabriela.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.25,0:28:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你没有打给我 真是伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't call me. That hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.13,0:28:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,该不会是你朝她开的枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't shoot the poor thing, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.80,0:28:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.05,0:28:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我先问你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.30,0:28:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.51,0:28:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.43,0:28:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望你有打给我 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you'd called me, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.35,0:28:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照我说的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.64,0:28:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.98,0:28:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是只有你一个人被改造过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the only one that's been enhanced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.28,0:29:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan.Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.11,0:29:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.83,0:29:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利班 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caliban, come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.33,0:29:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位就是我一直和你提起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is who I've been telling you about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.95,0:29:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.46,0:29:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直都在等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.30,0:29:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.51,0:29:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.34,0:29:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.85,0:29:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.22,0:29:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.81,0:29:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.06,0:29:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.69,0:29:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 没事的 你可以留在这儿 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. It's okay. You can stay here, Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.82,0:29:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿我们可以照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can look after you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.20,0:29:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.99,0:29:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着像退役军人 也可能是个赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like ex-military. Bounty hunter, maybe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.41,0:29:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.71,0:29:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就他一个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he by himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但只是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.00,0:29:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他搬上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get him back in his ride, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.42,0:30:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔到干河床那儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}take him out to the wash and dump him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.21,0:30:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他半路醒了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he wakes up before I get there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.05,0:30:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,发消息告诉我你在哪儿 我们去接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Text me where you are. We'll pick you up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.90,0:30:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.91,0:30:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗根 - 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Logan. - Hey.Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.41,0:30:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我搞明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get it back after I figure out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.12,0:30:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你妈妈的来龙去脉 我会还给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you and your mother have got us into.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.91,0:30:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 罗根 - 干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Logan. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.29,0:30:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 你可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.63,0:30:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 你遇到的那个女人并不是她的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, the woman that you met, that's not her mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.26,0:30:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以她会说话 - 我们一直都有交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So she talks? - We're communicating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.81,0:30:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,交流 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Communicating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.64,0:30:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把这些药吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take these now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.31,0:31:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上离开 这里已经不安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get out of here. It's not safe here anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.65,0:31:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能在外面发作 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can't have an attack out there, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 可她就是我告诉你的那个新变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but this is the mutant that I told you about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.28,0:31:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她需要帮助 - 她不是变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She needs our help. - She's not a mutant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.20,0:31:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她是变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, she is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.45,0:31:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她的天赋是什么 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's her gift, Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.70,0:31:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃东西 还是扔钢管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eating? Pipe throwing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.48,0:31:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.21,0:31:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.73,0:31:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.98,0:31:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着枪 把尸体扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the gun. Dump the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.06,0:31:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来的时候发消息给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Text me when you're on the way back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.32,0:31:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么需要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have anything else you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.65,0:31:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子吃的食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food for the kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.58,0:31:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下你完蛋了 变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fucked now, mutie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.87,0:32:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.16,0:32:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不是火车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a choc-choc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.43,0:32:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.51,0:32:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得走了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta go. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.02,0:32:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出什么事了 - 待在这儿 去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Where? Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.00,0:32:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别乱动 - 我们要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move. - Where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.10,0:32:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 他会回来找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't worry. He will be back for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.86,0:32:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 那女孩儿 你得回去接那女孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, the girl. You've got to go back for the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.70,0:32:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 那女孩儿怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, what about the girl?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.71,0:32:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.30,0:32:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 我们不能丢下劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, we mustn't forget about Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.76,0:32:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不归我们管\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not our problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.56,0:33:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.15,0:33:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.89,0:33:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.14,0:33:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我在想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.43,0:33:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.27,0:33:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 我们不能丢下劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, we mustn't forget Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.10,0:33:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你别说了 - 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please be quiet. - Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.61,0:33:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 查尔斯·泽维尔 - 卡利班在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charles Xavier. - Where's Caliban?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.99,0:33:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国头号八旬通缉犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}America's most wanted octogenarian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.12,0:33:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确说我已经九十多岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a nonagenarian, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.54,0:34:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利班在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Caliban?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.50,0:34:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你先告诉我那女孩儿在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you tell me where the girl is first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.21,0:34:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我可以问老光头 他看起来比较友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I could ask Cue Ball. He seems quite friendly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.30,0:34:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 她不在我这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, she's not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.97,0:34:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利班在哪儿 你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Caliban, motherfucker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.47,0:34:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他扔到了原本你为我预留的沟里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I left him in the same ditch he was gonna leave me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.20,0:34:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 金刚狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Wolverine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.49,0:34:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你这副样子我真是太心碎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing you like this just breaks my damn heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.66,0:34:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不想亲手把你的心挖出来碾碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I rip it out of your chest, fuck-stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.71,0:34:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.95,0:36:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.46,0:36:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thata girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.42,0:36:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.76,0:36:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.98,0:36:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.44,0:36:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 待在原地别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, you wanna stay where you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.81,0:36:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想见你的朋友是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna see your friends, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.82,0:36:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说无论生死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said alive or dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.95,0:36:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.62,0:36:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.99,0:36:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.54,0:36:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.96,0:36:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.30,0:37:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.68,0:37:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop shooting!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.64,0:37:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她能自愈 - 快追\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She heals! - Move! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.48,0:37:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.87,0:38:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 抓住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hold her down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.09,0:39:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就告诉你了 罗根 她和你一样是变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I told you, Logan, she's a mutant like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.09,0:39:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.26,0:39:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你非常像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very much like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.62,0:39:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.81,0:39:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.73,0:40:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.57,0:40:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.99,0:40:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.04,0:40:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.64,0:41:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,列阵 给我追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall in! Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.31,0:41:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.69,0:42:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.28,0:42:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把追踪者带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me the tracker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.00,0:42:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.88,0:42:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.72,0:42:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我在问你话呢 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I asked you a question. Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.80,0:42:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她是谁 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who she is, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.31,0:42:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.52,0:42:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得她很像谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she remind you of anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.34,0:43:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候读到过你的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read about you when I was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.34,0:43:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你认错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you're thinking of someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.44,0:43:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没记错 你曾经也为我们效过力吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if I'm not mistaken, you used to work for my team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.19,0:43:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我们围捕过那些变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were helping round up all those old mutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.86,0:43:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What changed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.45,0:43:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你信教了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got religion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.54,0:43:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need you to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.37,0:43:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的好人再做一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}one more thing for the good guys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.92,0:43:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,再帮我追踪一个特别的变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and track one more special mute for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.55,0:44:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not helping you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.43,0:44:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you'd say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.60,0:44:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我总觉得人的本质是不会变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got a theory that people don't really change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.06,0:44:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beware of the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.06,0:44:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利班 我猜小时候 你妈妈肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caliban, I bet that's what your mama told you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.27,0:44:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天都这么和你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}every day when you was a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.16,0:44:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beware of the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.33,0:44:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别让我们互相撕破脸皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's not bring out the worst in each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.17,0:44:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了那女孩儿不值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl is not worth it, trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.00,0:44:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不一样 她生下来不是变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not a natural fuck-up like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.42,0:44:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是公司犯下的错误 研发失误\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a business mistake, a R&D gone bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.26,0:44:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是个累赘\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's liability.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.76,0:44:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能就这么让专利产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't have things with patents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.30,0:44:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处乱跑 伤害无辜不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}running around, hurting people, can they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.26,0:44:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她伤害别人之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get her off the board{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.10,0:44:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把她带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}before she hurts anybody else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.93,0:44:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许下一个就是你在乎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone you care about, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.11,0:45:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好闻一闻吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, get to sniff in'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.95,0:45:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫做加芙列拉·洛佩兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Gabriela Lopez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.54,0:45:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是名护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a nurse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.79,0:45:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去十年 我一直在为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for 10 years, I worked for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.50,0:45:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,墨西哥城的基因改造研究所工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transigen Research in Mexico City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.17,0:45:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该研究所属于一家美国公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transigen is owned by an American company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.22,0:45:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来你们看到的 在美国和加拿大\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I am about to show you is illegal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.01,0:45:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是非法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the U.S. and Canada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.52,0:45:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这都是骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, of course, that was a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.40,0:45:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些孩子都出生在研究所里\N{\fnArial\fs30}These children were born in Transigen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.82,0:45:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们出生在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were born here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.36,0:45:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就再也没离开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have never left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.91,0:45:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从来没见过阳光和大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have never seen the sun or the ocean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.33,0:45:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,雨水或飘雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}rain or snow…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.16,0:45:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者上帝的其它造物\N{\fnArial\fs30}or any of God's creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.83,0:45:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有出生证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have no birth certificates…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.21,0:46:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}no names…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.50,0:46:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我们给他们的代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}besides the ones we have given them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.22,0:46:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是在墨西哥女孩的肚子里孕育出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were raised in the bellies of Mexican girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.35,0:46:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子出生后女孩儿就再也找不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls no one can find anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.93,0:46:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的父亲都是些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their fathers are semillas geneticas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.35,0:46:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}special seeds in bottles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.49,0:46:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有过生日吗 - 玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Birthday? No birth. - Maria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.87,0:46:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,万圣节别给孩子打扮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not dress them up for Halloween.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.37,0:46:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫他们宝贝 也别叫他们亲亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not call them "baby" or kiss boo-boos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.75,0:46:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把他们看作孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't think of them as children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.92,0:46:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们是产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of them as things…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.09,0:46:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有专利有版权的产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}with patents and copyrights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.71,0:46:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comprende?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.80,0:46:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si, senor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.55,0:46:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为我们又穷又傻 根本不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought we were too poor and stupid to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.14,0:46:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是很穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're poor, yes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.22,0:46:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们并不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we are not stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.39,0:46:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,运用你的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use your powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.82,0:47:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是桩生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.32,0:47:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在制造士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are making soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.40,0:47:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀人机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.33,0:47:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年幼的变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are babies of mutantes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.25,0:47:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,北达科他州\N{\fnArial\fs30}North Dakota.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.80,0:47:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿了那女人的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took that woman's money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.93,0:47:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应会带那孩子去那儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you would take the child there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.77,0:47:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.60,0:47:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是你女儿 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's your daughter, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.44,0:47:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔卡利有你的遗传密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alkali has your genetic code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.32,0:47:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.61,0:47:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.65,0:47:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想谈这事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.78,0:47:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不想听你再说下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna hear about it anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.85,0:47:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗根 - 别再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Logan… - Just stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.95,0:47:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想尿尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to pee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.46,0:48:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.93,0:48:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.60,0:48:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 看在上帝的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. For God's sake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.94,0:48:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this myself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.44,0:48:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 可你并没有成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you're not doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.61,0:48:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧尿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get on with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.81,0:48:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站在那我怎么尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not with you standing there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.52,0:48:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我不会偷看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, I'm not lookin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.06,0:49:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.69,0:49:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.31,0:49:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吃东西要给钱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you gotta pay for that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.86,0:49:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸妈妈在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Where's your mommy and daddy, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.82,0:49:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.99,0:49:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,闹够了 这个给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough. These, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.37,0:49:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.62,0:49:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.87,0:49:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.13,0:49:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 手机充电器有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, do you sell phone chargers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.38,0:49:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.01,0:49:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 到车上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.79,0:50:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着孩子慢慢长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the children became older…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.87,0:50:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura. Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.42,0:50:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们变得越来越难相处\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they became more difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.59,0:50:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们控制不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could not be controlled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.80,0:50:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司把他们变成了武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The company made their bodies into weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.93,0:50:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始教他们如何杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried to teach them to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.10,0:50:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他们不想战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they did not want to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.10,0:50:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想打仗的士兵对他们来说毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}A soldier who will not fight is useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.98,0:50:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这栋大楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside this building…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.11,0:50:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在研究新的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are working on something new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.11,0:50:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个比这些孩子更强的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something they think is better than the children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.70,0:50:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说那是个没有灵魂的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something they say is without a soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.20,0:50:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯博士 你看过完整的报告了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to hear my full lab report, Dr. Rice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.83,0:50:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里吃不到寿司\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't get good sushi here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.75,0:50:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就像科罗拉多州的丹佛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Mexican equivalent of Denver, Colorado.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.13,0:50:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定已经成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have been successful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.50,0:50:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约一周以前 他们告诉我们要停止项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a week ago, they told us to shut our program down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.84,0:51:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始对那些孩子实施安乐死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They started putting the children to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.68,0:51:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要救出尽可能多的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to save as many children as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.98,0:51:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一个地方 在北方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read about a place, up north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.48,0:51:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个属于变种人的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place for mutants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.44,0:51:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们称之为伊甸园\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call it Eden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.16,0:51:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你看到了这段视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are watching this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.46,0:51:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那证明我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it means that I am dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.38,0:51:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道还有没有其它幸存下来的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}lam not sure if any other children survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.80,0:51:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were separated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.30,0:51:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有另一笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no more money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.51,0:51:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我骗了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.64,0:51:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.73,0:51:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I love her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.35,0:51:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不会像我一样爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not love her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.32,0:51:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她是你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she is your child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.86,0:52:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I beg you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.66,0:52:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她送到安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}take her to safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.91,0:52:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要躲在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this where we're hiding out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.79,0:52:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不躲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not hiding out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.04,0:52:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,找个地方睡几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get a couple of hours' sleep…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.25,0:52:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,清洗一下 找几件新衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}clean up, get some new clothes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.92,0:53:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,换俩新车离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}get a new ride and get outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.60,0:53:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈拉大赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harrah's Hotel and Casino{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.14,0:53:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎您来到俄克拉荷马市\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcomes you to Oklahoma City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.14,0:53:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要使用停车服务请靠右行驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please keep right for valet parking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.10,0:53:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.27,0:53:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢乐尽在哈拉大赌场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fun never stops at Harrah's Hotel and Casino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.94,0:53:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就停在门口 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, keep it out front, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.78,0:53:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.18,0:53:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.52,0:53:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.64,0:53:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need clothes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.49,0:54:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯上行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.83,0:54:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 住手 这不是玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, stop. Not a toy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.83,0:54:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 抱歉 有轮椅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, no, sorry, chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.86,0:54:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.00,0:54:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push up again. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.34,0:54:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯上行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.54,0:54:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 站好 站好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Stand there. Just stand there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.71,0:54:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 这个给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan, it's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.84,0:54:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.01,0:54:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna wear it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.14,0:54:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到了房间里我再换\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the room. We'll get changed in the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.56,0:54:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个卑鄙的美国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a low-down, lying Yankee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.18,0:54:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.90,0:54:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一部很有名的电影 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a very famous picture, Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.82,0:54:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都快有一百年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost 100 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.55,0:55:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论天上人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}In life, in death, oh, Lord{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.56,0:55:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,求主与我同住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abide with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.11,0:55:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我第一次看这部电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I first saw this picture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.40,0:55:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在我家乡的埃索达电影院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the Essoldo Cinema in my hometown…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.07,0:55:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我和你差不多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I was your age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.41,0:55:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿人都尊你的名为圣 愿你的国降临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who art in heaven Hallowed be thy name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.91,0:55:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿你的旨意行在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thy kingdom come, thy will be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.26,0:55:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.30,0:56:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yankee liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.14,0:56:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.44,0:56:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你平时就看这个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read these in your spare time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.82,0:56:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 查尔斯 X战警有新粉丝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, Charles, we got ourselves an X-Men fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.82,0:56:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道里面都是瞎写的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know they're all bullshit, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.61,0:56:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能其中四分之一确有其事 但也不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a quarter of it happened, and not like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.57,0:56:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在现实世界里人会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the real world, people die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.99,0:56:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有穿着紧身衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no self-promoting asshole{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.91,0:57:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,自命不凡的傻子来救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a fucking leotard can stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.58,0:57:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是用来安慰失败者的冰激凌\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ice cream for bed-wetters.Logan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.71,0:57:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女的一直都在给她灌输美丽的童话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her nurse has been feeding her some grade-A bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.17,0:57:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得劳拉不需要别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think Laura needs reminding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.63,0:57:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒她生命无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}of life's impermanence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.55,0:57:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说要找辆新车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you say something about finding us a new ride?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.22,0:57:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小时后吃两粒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two more pills in one hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.93,0:57:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give 'em to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.68,0:57:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 谢恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Shane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.22,0:57:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,人必须忠于自己 乔伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man has to be what he is, Joey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.52,0:57:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能违背自己的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't break the mold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.48,0:57:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试过了 可最终还是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried it and it didn't work for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.98,0:57:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔伊 带着杀戮活下去很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joey, there's no living with a killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.48,0:57:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路没有退路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no going back from one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.57,0:57:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对是错 你都得背负\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right or wrong, it's a brand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.03,0:57:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,直至一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A brand sticks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.57,0:57:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在快回去找你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you run on home to your mother, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.08,0:57:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell her everything's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.95,0:57:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,山谷里再不会有枪声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there aren't any more guns in the valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.73,0:58:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.48,0:58:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是警察？可我已经把我知道的都告诉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More cops? 'Cause I told the other guys everything that I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.24,0:58:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 到笼子里去 追踪者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up! In your cage, tracker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.74,0:58:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没你的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did your job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.10,0:58:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.74,0:59:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.83,0:59:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,送你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock yourselves out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.21,0:59:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,最低8000\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what. Eight grand…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.67,0:59:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你喷新漆 换一下轮胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have her freshly painted for you, new tires…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.08,0:59:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,安装调试好 再帮你把手续办了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mounted, balanced, and complete paperwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.84,0:59:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你10000\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you 10 as-is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.13,0:59:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,手续的事就跳过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you can forget the paperwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.42,0:59:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是需要换轮胎 不换不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you still need new tires, man, they're bald.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.80,0:59:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久能办好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will that take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.09,0:59:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.71,0:59:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.89,1:00:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在逗我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be fucking kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.53,1:00:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你的钥匙 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, are the keys in… Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.74,1:00:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的钥匙在车里吗 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the keys in it? Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.46,1:00:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.40,1:00:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles. Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.97,1:01:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯上行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.90,1:03:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.24,1:03:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.53,1:03:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.08,1:03:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.25,1:04:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.28,1:04:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急救护人员仍在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency personnel are still on scene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.03,1:04:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄克拉荷马市的哈利士赌场旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Harrah's Casino Hotel in Oklahoma City…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.82,1:04:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨日至少400人出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}where at least 400 guests were stricken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.82,1:04:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时性麻痹症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}with temporary paralysis yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.99,1:04:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,受伤情况大都\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many are noting a similarity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.70,1:04:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一年前的韦斯切斯特事故十分相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Westchester incident over a year ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.58,1:04:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时有超过600人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}that left over 600 injured…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.42,1:04:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,7名变种人身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and took the lives of seven mutants, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.71,1:04:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中包括几名X战警\N{\fnArial\fs30}including several of the X-Men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.92,1:04:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.92,1:04:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你别玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, knock it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.59,1:04:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是个孩子 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a child, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.68,1:04:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 她是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, point of fact, she's your…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.35,1:04:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次吃药是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long has it been since you took your meds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.27,1:05:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 隔了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, how long has it been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.39,1:05:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.40,1:05:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.90,1:05:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天发生的事你也看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what happened yesterday. If that shit had gone on any longer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.65,1:05:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是我及时赶到\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone in that casino…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.82,1:05:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是尽我所能保护劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I had to do to save Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.24,1:05:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.70,1:05:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是受了惊吓发病了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just freaked out and had a fucking seizure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.78,1:05:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你更喜欢我吃了药像疯子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you prefer me pharmaceutically castrated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.24,1:05:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,语无伦次的模样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}rambling on like a lunatic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.29,1:05:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你就能轻松些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much easier for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.96,1:05:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easier? Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.21,1:05:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你在一起就不会轻松 从来不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing easy about you, Charles, nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.59,1:05:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这世上其它人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, please be like the rest of the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.21,1:05:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己的过错都怪罪到别人头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}blaming someone else for your boring shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.88,1:05:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 老爹 你对我太失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Pop, I'm such a giant disappointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.88,1:05:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的打心底不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honestly derive no sense of purpose…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.89,1:05:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}from what we're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.10,1:05:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们到底在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what are we doing? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.39,1:05:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个新生的变种人坐在我们的车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a young mutant sitting in our car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.10,1:05:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I see that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.31,1:05:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们要去的地方还有其它的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where we're taking her, there are others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.69,1:05:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你还看不出这意味着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean nothing to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.65,1:05:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我看不出个所以然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, means nothing to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.86,1:05:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是当我知道那个护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially since Nurse Gabriela…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.40,1:05:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的伊甸园是根据漫画胡编乱造出来的之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}made all that Eden shit up with fucking comic books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.99,1:05:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.83,1:05:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这个给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give those to him, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.99,1:06:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该吃药了 拿两片给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out two pills and give them to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.24,1:06:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗根 罗根 - 把药给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Logan!Logan! - Give 'em to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.96,1:06:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.00,1:06:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,张嘴我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.86,1:06:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯博士 我们马上就能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Rice. It's under control…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.18,1:07:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的无人卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucking auto-trucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.89,1:07:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别爆粗口 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Language, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.27,1:07:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冲着一台机器发火干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're screaming at a machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.56,1:07:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 她可以杀人不眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what? She can gut a man with her feet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.40,1:07:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,却听不得脏话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}she can't hear a few naughty words, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.94,1:07:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以教她成为更好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can learn to be better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.69,1:07:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说和我比吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, better than me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.32,1:07:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点儿没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.78,1:07:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 劳拉脚上的爪子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, by the way, Laura's foot claws…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.12,1:07:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然是由于性别所致\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the obvious result of her gender, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.87,1:07:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a fact?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.25,1:07:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在狮群当中 母狮子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a pride of lions, the female…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.33,1:07:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,既要负责捕猎 又要负责照顾狮群\N{\fnArial\fs30}is both hunter and caregiver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.96,1:07:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真长知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.42,1:07:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们用前爪捕猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}She uses her front claws for hunting…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.09,1:07:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,用后爪防御\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the back claws defensively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.51,1:07:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.59,1:07:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样才能幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, ensuring their survival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.52,1:07:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.59,1:08:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得帮他们一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.55,1:08:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们得赶路 有人会来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we have to keep going. Someone will come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.01,1:08:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不就是我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.32,1:09:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, you need a hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.74,1:09:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好 推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready? Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.03,1:09:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Good, got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.37,1:09:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们回家吧 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}CXmTmaon, let's get home. Laura!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.50,1:09:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much for your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.08,1:09:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫凯瑟琳 - 詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Kathryn. - James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.03,1:09:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子内特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my son, Nate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.27,1:09:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.55,1:09:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你女儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.84,1:09:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 她叫劳拉 那是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's Laura, and that's my dad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.76,1:09:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,查克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.05,1:09:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 劳拉 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Laura, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.09,1:09:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想请你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, can we show our appreciation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.10,1:09:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我们家吃顿晚饭以示感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and treat the three of you to a decent meal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.76,1:09:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家离这儿不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't live far from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.22,1:09:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 不 谢谢 - 那真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, no, thanks. - That would be lovely!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.03,1:10:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莱斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Dr. Rice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.24,1:10:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢也可以叫我桑德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can call me Zander if you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.20,1:10:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同事告诉我你不太愿意配合我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My colleague tells me you've been somewhat resistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.41,1:10:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你给他的消息总是不及时\N{\fnArial\fs30}He believes you've been dispensing delayed information…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.21,1:10:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的朋友总是快我们一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}to allow your friends to stay one step ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.75,1:10:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是在给你赎罪的机会 卡利班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm offering you the possibility of redemption, Caliban.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.38,1:10:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去保护这个世界 同时拯救你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect the world, and in the process, save your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.72,1:10:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那个小女孩儿只是一个小小的代价而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl is a rather small price to pay for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.14,1:10:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是你的同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlike you, she's impure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.10,1:10:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是天生的变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't made by nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.98,1:10:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是我犯下的一个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a mistake of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.39,1:10:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽了全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I could{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.48,1:10:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他们用光照我 打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they burned me and beat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.90,1:10:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同事都是群野蛮人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your colleagues are savages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.15,1:10:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.65,1:10:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些掠夺者都是群废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Reavers were very ineffective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.65,1:10:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我带了新的帮手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm bringing new tools to bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.74,1:10:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我还是需要有人为我们指明方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I still need someone to point us in the right direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.99,1:10:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.41,1:10:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 别激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe, breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.24,1:10:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个老头现在情况有多糟糕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what does he have? The old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.41,1:10:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,老年痴呆症？渐冻症？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alzheimer's? ALS?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.17,1:10:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上最危险的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A degenerative brain disease{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.00,1:11:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然得了脑退化\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the world's most dangerous brain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.25,1:11:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是造物弄人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a combo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.17,1:11:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,开饭了 我们有客人 规矩点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be nice. Now, you know we got company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.47,1:11:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.68,1:11:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 快请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, have a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.01,1:11:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特快坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate, sit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.47,1:11:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯 你坐在桌子那边吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, why don't you sit at the end of the table?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.18,1:11:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来做祷告好吗 来吧宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna say grace? Say grace, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.10,1:11:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝 赐予我们食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, thank you, God, for this food…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.44,1:11:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有感谢我们的新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for our new friends, the Howletts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.15,1:11:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢他们的帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. They came to our aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.61,1:11:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿门 - 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.36,1:11:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿门 给你查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Here you go, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.70,1:11:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.88,1:11:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她想吃还有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's plenty more if she wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.63,1:11:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.39,1:11:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,菜的味道很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.55,1:11:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 真的很好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, thank you. - It's so good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.97,1:11:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you all headed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.52,1:11:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 俄勒冈州 - 南达科他州\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh… Oregon. - South Dakota.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.85,1:12:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,先去俄勒冈 然后再去南达科他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Oregon and then South Dakota.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.40,1:12:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,去度假吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vacation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.90,1:12:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.32,1:12:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划了很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, long overdue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.24,1:12:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们住在城市里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're city folk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.65,1:12:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都想沿着公路自驾游 看看整个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always wanted to take a road trip, see the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.37,1:12:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有看看不同的风土人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… And meet the people in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.91,1:12:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.33,1:12:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都想说服威尔去度假 都好几年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been trying to get Will here to take a vacation for years now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.25,1:12:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们到处旅游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. If we go traipsing all over the country, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.87,1:12:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来打理这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's gonna take care of this place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.04,1:12:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 所以才让你卖了农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. I say, let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.09,1:12:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那靠什么养家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And live off what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.25,1:12:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝会眷顾我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord will provide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.17,1:12:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在等上帝赐予我一台\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still waiting for the Lord to provide me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.05,1:12:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的打谷机呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a new thresher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.43,1:12:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正总有一天我会去旅行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the same, I'd love to travel someday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.59,1:12:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信会有那么一天的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I bet you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.35,1:12:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以退学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could drop out of schooL{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.43,1:12:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 别说得像真的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's not go that far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.52,1:12:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.77,1:12:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 为什么不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.10,1:12:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是想去旅行吗 我也想\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna travel, I wanna travel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.52,1:12:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son. Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.94,1:12:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,正合你意对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds good to you, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.11,1:12:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the perfect plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.57,1:12:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么想要退学呢 内特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you want to do that, Nate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.69,1:12:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意了 他可是个创办过学校的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, you're speaking to a man who ran a school…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.70,1:12:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还开了好多年对吧 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a lot of years. Right, Charles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.74,1:12:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 是的 那是一所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it was a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.24,1:12:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一所为特殊孩子开设的学校 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a special needs school. Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.58,1:13:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 这个解释不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. That's a good description.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.87,1:13:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.46,1:13:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, no. Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.59,1:13:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还被开除过几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got kicked out a few times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.92,1:13:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望能夸你是个好学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could say you were a good pupil, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.63,1:13:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我就是说不出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the words would choke me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.57,1:13:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的非常感谢你们的款待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, I can't thank you enough for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.66,1:13:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚真的很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it was great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.16,1:13:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们还得赶路\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have a long drive ahead of us, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.12,1:13:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你们总得休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you need to rest, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.41,1:13:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到旅馆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll find a motel somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.08,1:13:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的开过去也要两个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nearest one is two hours from here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.16,1:13:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,条件还不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's not even that nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.67,1:13:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们楼上有个空房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a perfectly fine room upstairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.63,1:13:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以给你父亲和女儿住\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your father and your daughter and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.79,1:13:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你可以睡在客厅的折迭沙发上\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can sleep in the living room on the convertible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.50,1:13:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳 真的很感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathryn, it's very, very nice of you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.80,1:13:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们还是不打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we really should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.13,1:13:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以明天一早再走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can leave early in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.47,1:13:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一亮就走 你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break of dawn, as it were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.47,1:14:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我给你洗漱一下吧 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, why don't we wash up, Pop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.60,1:14:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.69,1:14:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.02,1:14:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 要来点甜品吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, sweetie, you want some dessert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.82,1:14:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天的路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days on the road, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.19,1:14:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就吃了一顿饭 还几乎没睡过觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}only one meal, and hardly any sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.28,1:14:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她才11岁 而我90了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's 11, I'm fucking 90.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.49,1:14:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们有101个理由继续赶路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's 101 reasons to keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.49,1:14:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是一盒牛油果 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a box of avocados, Logan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.66,1:14:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢 过了今晚然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what? We stay the night, then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.45,1:14:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们带她去伊甸园找她的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we take her to her friends in Eden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.21,1:14:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 然后我们就去买逐日号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we buy the Sunseeker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.13,1:14:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,先吃药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the pills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.89,1:14:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.56,1:14:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 内特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? - Nate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.22,1:14:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁还有点水压快去把浴缸放满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go fill up the tub before we lose pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.39,1:14:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 检查下水槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, check the sink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.89,1:14:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们又把水给断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shut it off again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.98,1:14:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就是不肯罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are just not going to let this thing go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.65,1:14:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好现在就去处理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you might as well handle it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.23,1:14:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到明天早上吧 昨晚刚下过雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can wait till the morning. We just had rain last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.15,1:14:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,可家里还有客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got three houseguests{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.57,1:14:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一大堆碟子没洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a sink full of dishes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.74,1:14:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.24,1:15:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,供水站离这里大概一英里半\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pump station that supplies us is a mile and a half from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.20,1:15:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的时候它会停止运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes it gets itself shut off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.04,1:15:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是那群混蛋 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By assholes. - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.20,1:15:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.58,1:15:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我儿子可以和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son is happy to go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.67,1:15:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, that's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.58,1:15:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人有的时候不太…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The men that do this, sometimes they can be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.59,1:15:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你一起去 - 不 你得做作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can go. - No, you got homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.51,1:15:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.17,1:15:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先安顿好我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, let me get my dad settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.72,1:15:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.39,1:15:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我不在乎律师说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, I don't care what the lawyer says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.10,1:15:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这样很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.90,1:15:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让他们伤害我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hurt our chances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.45,1:15:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有电视 要看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want TV? There's TV here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.79,1:15:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.91,1:15:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.12,1:15:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Logan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.71,1:15:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活就应该像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is what life looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.30,1:15:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个家 家人彼此相爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A home, people who love each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.09,1:15:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全的港湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.42,1:16:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该花时间感受一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should take a moment and feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.81,1:16:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这儿很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.93,1:16:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan.Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.44,1:16:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.11,1:16:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯 世界已经变了样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles, the world is not the same as it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.66,1:16:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里我们会有风险 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking a risk hanging around here, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.91,1:16:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我们要去的那个伊甸园\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where we're going, Eden…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.45,1:16:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实并不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.75,1:16:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是护士从漫画书上看来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her nurse got it from a comic book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.79,1:16:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂了吗 都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand? It's not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.84,1:16:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对劳拉来说是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is for Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.76,1:16:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对劳拉来说是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is for Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.14,1:16:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.98,1:16:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎伍德饮料公司买下了这里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canewood Beverage bought up everything out here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.02,1:16:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我们的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.36,1:16:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想卖 他们就想强行征用\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we wouldn't sell, they tried eminent domain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.15,1:17:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后断我们的水源\N{\fnArial\fs30}then screwing with our water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.78,1:17:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月前有人下毒杀死了我们的狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of months ago, somebody poisoned our dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.87,1:17:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以今天在公路上也不是意外？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, out on the highway today, those trucks…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.49,1:17:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows. Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.37,1:17:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.96,1:17:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一只四肢发达头脑简单的恐龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look like dinosaurs with their 20-ton bodies and tiny little brains…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.38,1:17:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在给他们的超级转基因玉米剥壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}shucking their cloned-up super corn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.71,1:17:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿味道简直像屎一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it tastes like shit, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.13,1:17:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么还有人吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do people eat it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.55,1:17:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吃的 是用来喝的 玉米糖浆 加了那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't. They drink it. Corn syrup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.05,1:17:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就能保持清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in those drinks that everyone's having…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.97,1:17:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有精神 还能带来性欲什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stay awake, cheer up, feel strong, sexy, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.73,1:17:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,今时不同往日了 它能让你一杯解千愁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be a time when a bad day was just a bad day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.73,1:17:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜对我没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine still are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.09,1:17:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是套牛比赛赢来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are for breakaway roping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.92,1:18:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些事绕桶比赛得来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are for barrel racing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.92,1:18:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这些 绕杆比赛得来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and right here is for pole bending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.09,1:18:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过全是二三等奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all second, third place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.10,1:18:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很在行 不过我爸爸硬要我参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not too good at it, but my dad makes me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.44,1:18:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to listen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.70,1:18:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.75,1:18:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 借你听一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, here, you can take it for tonight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.25,1:18:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早你再还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll get it back from you in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.14,1:18:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来得弄一会儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're gonna be here a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.68,1:19:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,能撑一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.14,1:19:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.51,1:19:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,撑到下一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till next time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.68,1:19:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.77,1:19:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你女儿那样有多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so, uh, how long has your girl been like that? Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.19,1:19:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.19,1:19:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一开始就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, since the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.62,1:19:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我还挺羡慕你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in a lot of ways, I envy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.79,1:19:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等她到了内特的年纪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get to be Nate's age, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.04,1:19:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会说些蠢话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the nonsense that comes out of their mouths…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.96,1:20:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你怀疑做父母的意义何在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you wonder the whole point of it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.67,1:20:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.38,1:20:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.55,1:20:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会用上枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.47,1:20:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.89,1:20:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 芒森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, Mr. Munson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.73,1:20:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么风把你吹来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brings y'all this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.90,1:20:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不问问你的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you ask your boys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.48,1:20:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,芒森先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Munson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.73,1:20:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你这样是非法入侵吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you understand you're trespassing right now, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.49,1:20:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和这里以前的主人签订过地役权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an easement with the previous owner of your property.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.16,1:20:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. Bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.66,1:20:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也说是「前」主人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Previous" being the operative word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.87,1:20:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.41,1:20:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,劝你赶紧回车上去的好心人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a guy telling you to get back in your nice truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.08,1:20:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到别的地方去扮你的地痞流氓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go play Okie dickhead somewhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.21,1:20:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Carl…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.01,1:20:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来芒森先生雇了一个打手\N{\fnArial\fs30}it looks like Mr. Munson hired some muscle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.34,1:20:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.85,1:20:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.43,1:20:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友口气挺大\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend with a big mouth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.43,1:20:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话我听得多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear that a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.85,1:21:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你肯定也听过这个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you probably hear this, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.06,1:21:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,多了去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than I'd like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.77,1:21:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你知道该怎么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know the drill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.11,1:21:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数三下\N{\fnArial\fs30}L'mma count to three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.11,1:21:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们给我离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're gonna start walking away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.61,1:21:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的水我有权使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got rights to this water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.70,1:21:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一 - 我请了律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One. - I have a lawyer now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.95,1:21:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.62,1:21:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.87,1:21:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,头儿 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right, boss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.29,1:21:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道该怎么做了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the drill. Pick up my goddamn hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.13,1:21:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧给我滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.29,1:21:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 头儿？- 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay, boss? - Fuck off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.21,1:21:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.31,1:21:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受过训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've had training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.23,1:21:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.00,1:22:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,先别叫醒她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't wake her yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.50,1:22:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她再睡一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her sleep another hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.26,1:22:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Logan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.68,1:22:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 今天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}this was, without a doubt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.81,1:22:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我这么久以来度过的最美好的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most perfect night I've had in a very long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.82,1:22:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我并不配拥有它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.79,1:22:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.46,1:22:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做过一些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.46,1:22:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些不可言说的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something unspeakable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.80,1:23:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生在维斯切斯特的事我全记起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've remembered what happened in Westchester.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.02,1:23:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经不是我第一次伤害别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the first time I've hurt people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.36,1:23:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是在今天之前 我一直都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until today, I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.57,1:23:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.74,1:23:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就这样一直逃避下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just kept on running away from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.17,1:23:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我终于能理解你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I finally understand you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.26,1:23:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logan…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.29,1:24:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他简直完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fantastic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.79,1:24:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过你只要那个女孩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you only needed the girl!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.29,1:24:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说过我带了新帮手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I was forced to bring a new tool to bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.59,1:24:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给过你朋友机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends had every chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.96,1:24:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so did you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.30,1:24:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,内特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.14,1:24:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.94,1:24:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.48,1:24:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别上来 威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down there, Will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.44,1:24:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.81,1:24:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathryn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.41,1:24:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathryn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.66,1:24:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathryn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.48,1:25:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.61,1:25:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.12,1:25:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,按住伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.29,1:25:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我 那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't me. It wasn't me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.04,1:25:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.96,1:25:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以过去接他 在半路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could pick him up, meet him halfway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.38,1:25:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 让他们过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Let them come to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.01,1:25:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,X-23很不好对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}We struggled with the X-23s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.30,1:25:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本以为能把这些孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We assumed, because they were children…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.55,1:25:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,从小培养成冷血杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could raise them without a conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.01,1:25:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,可愤怒是无法后天培养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't nurture rage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.06,1:25:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须从一开始就为他设定好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must simply design it… from scratch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.07,1:26:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又是该死的谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the fuck is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.32,1:26:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,威尔·芒森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Munson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.74,1:26:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住 查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold on, Charles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.75,1:26:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,芒森 该死的 给我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Munson, God damn it, come out here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.25,1:26:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,芒森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Munson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.01,1:26:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out here now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.22,1:26:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚出来 芒森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out here now, Munson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.93,1:26:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是刚才那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's that asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.22,1:26:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.72,1:26:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 过去的事我就不计较了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm willing to let bygones be bygones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.93,1:26:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道芒森那家伙付你多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what Munson's paying you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.35,1:26:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坎伍德现在给你5000美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Canewood can start you out at five G.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.06,1:26:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指一星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week, that is.{\r}
