Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.74,1:39:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路非常远\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a long way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.82,1:39:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.86,1:39:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会送你去北达科他州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not taking you to North Dakota.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.41,1:39:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我撑不下去了 我没法送你去那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fucked up. And I cannot get you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.87,1:39:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要两天的路程 我不会送你去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a two-day drive. And I am not taking you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.17,1:39:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 别打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't fucking hit me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.05,1:39:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再打了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hit me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.88,1:39:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,约拿 吉迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jonah, Gideon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.17,1:39:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再念这些名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop saying those names. …Rebecca…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.34,1:39:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛利拉 瑞克特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delilah, Rictor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.43,1:39:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到没 别再念了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now. Stop saying those names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.05,1:39:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.68,1:39:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck it. Fine, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.11,1:39:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要去是吧 我就带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna go? I'll take you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.56,1:39:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己亲眼去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.40,1:39:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起去你那该死的童话世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go to fucking fantasyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.58,1:40:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道控制局势的重要性 莱斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand the importance of containment, Dr. Rice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.25,1:40:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是不能像你之前在华瑞兹那样大动干戈啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't leave a war zone behind like you did in Juarez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.58,1:40:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, try to remind yourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.79,1:40:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是杀人机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}that these are all little killing machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.21,1:40:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻易就能杀掉你全家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Machines who would've happily disemboweled your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.26,1:40:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不都是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.42,1:40:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说了把他们解决掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told you want these assets off-board, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.38,1:40:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}dead or alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.64,1:40:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你改了我的命令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you changing my brief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.05,1:40:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.30,1:40:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还废话什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.43,1:40:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,提取他的细胞组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save tissue from this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.73,1:40:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他擅长追踪 具有高智商\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good tracker and had a high IQ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.23,1:40:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.35,1:41:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.36,1:41:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.29,1:41:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.29,1:41:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别盯着我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit looking at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.26,1:41:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No comprende.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.01,1:41:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.39,1:41:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.73,1:41:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charles told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.36,1:41:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还告诉了你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did he tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.03,1:42:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}To not let you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.71,1:42:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.76,1:42:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.34,1:45:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.18,1:45:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,往我这边来点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swing him toward me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.26,1:45:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.85,1:45:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.Easy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.26,1:45:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样可以吗 瑞克多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this good, Rictor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.43,1:45:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用那么多 少点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not so much. Less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.94,1:46:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.94,1:46:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.11,1:46:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.16,1:46:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,从哪儿弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.62,1:46:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们来的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.62,1:46:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗时他们给我们这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave it to us when we would fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.66,1:46:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们变得更强\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes you stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.83,1:46:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西只会让你发狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes you crazy, is what it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.75,1:46:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.83,1:46:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 如果你控制好剂量的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not if you use it in small doses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.50,1:46:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会帮你恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's helping you heal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.30,1:46:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Laura?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.80,1:46:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在下面睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's asleep down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.93,1:46:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我叫醒她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to wake her up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.44,1:46:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.83,1:47:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做噩梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a nightmare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.38,1:47:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会做噩梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have nightmares?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.47,1:47:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.73,1:47:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦里有人会伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}People hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.35,1:47:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine are different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.02,1:47:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦里我伤害了别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hurt people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.33,1:47:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.71,1:47:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是用艾德曼合金做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's made out of Adamantium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.38,1:47:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们在我们体内注入的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what they put inside of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.55,1:48:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它能杀死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it can kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.18,1:48:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许正是它在要我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably what is killing me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.56,1:48:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.44,1:48:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我很久以前得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got this a long time ago…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.57,1:48:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留着它是想提醒我 自己究竟是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I kept it as a reminder of what I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.28,1:48:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我留着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I keep it to, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.12,1:48:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,实话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.88,1:48:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想过用它来自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking of shooting myself with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.75,1:48:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Charles said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.97,1:48:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也伤害过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hurt people, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.93,1:48:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得学会如何面对这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to learn how to live with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.32,1:49:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were bad people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.12,1:49:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有差别\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.82,1:50:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好玩 这一点都不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not funny. That is not funny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.70,1:50:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.20,1:50:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I been out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.16,1:50:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在床上躺了多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I been in that bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.54,1:50:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.00,1:50:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就在这儿守了两天？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been sitting here for two days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.33,1:50:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去告诉大家可以开始打包了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, go inside and tell everyone to get packing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.92,1:50:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能这样 不能坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that. You can't just stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.67,1:50:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须等待 计划就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to wait. It was the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.71,1:50:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是我们集合的最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone had till today to find their way here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.22,1:50:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you keep waiting, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.26,1:50:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔卡利会找到你们 然后把你们全部杀掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alkali will find you and they will kill you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.89,1:50:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.01,1:50:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天天亮前我们就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're leaving tomorrow before dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.51,1:50:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会穿过边界去加拿大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna cross the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.27,1:50:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有避难所\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a safe haven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.10,1:50:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,请确认坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same coordinates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.52,1:51:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 已确认了正午到五点之间是卫星盲点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, between noon and 5:00. Satellites are blind then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.40,1:51:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的庇护要求已批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your asylum approved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.61,1:51:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.75,1:51:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你往右边看 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swing it to your right, Laura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.92,1:51:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,再往右一点 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little more. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.93,1:51:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到树林了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the woods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.39,1:51:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Si.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.06,1:51:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,要走8英里才能到那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an eight mile hike through there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.64,1:51:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那条通道没\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you see that pass?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.27,1:51:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.27,1:51:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那里我们就安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where we will be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.41,1:51:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.79,1:51:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉告诉我你为她所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura told me all that you did for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.79,1:52:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很幸运有你在她身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was lucky to have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.30,1:52:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着吧 她说这是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it. She says it's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.13,1:52:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是你送她来的目的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you did it, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.93,1:52:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.47,1:52:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不需要了 你们留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't need it. You do, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.64,1:52:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.96,1:52:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友们看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends, they seem nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.79,1:52:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想起了当年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of reminds me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.50,1:52:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.01,1:52:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经找到同伴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're with your pals. You made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.39,1:52:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where will you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.01,1:52:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,先去最近的酒吧看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearest bar, for starters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.85,1:53:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把你送到了 我的使命完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I got you here. That's all I signed up for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.48,1:53:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还把钱还给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even gave back the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.52,1:53:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a nice man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.69,1:53:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不是我想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I never asked for this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.57,1:53:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗 这也不是查尔斯想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Charles never asked for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.53,1:53:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不是卡利班想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caliban never asked for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.20,1:53:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们都躺在土里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they are six feet under the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.37,1:53:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道查尔斯给你灌输了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know what Charles put in your head…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.54,1:53:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我不是你心里想的那样 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I am not whatever it is you think I am, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.71,1:53:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你不过一个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only met you, like, a week ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.21,1:53:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到了你的丽贝卡 你的黛利拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your Rebecca, your Delilah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.34,1:53:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其它乱七八糟的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}your blah, blah, blah, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.21,1:53:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要的都已经得到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you asked for, you've got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.89,1:53:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这样更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is better this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.22,1:53:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我总是搞砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I suck at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.89,1:53:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,厄运总会降临在我在乎的人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad shit happens to people I care about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.19,1:53:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.94,1:53:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.45,1:55:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 往山里跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Towards the mountains! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.48,1:57:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 罗比 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Bobby, run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.88,1:57:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.00,1:57:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,再快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.17,1:57:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他们越过边界前 我们得抓住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to reach them before they get to the border.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.08,1:58:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.50,1:58:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.34,1:59:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.97,1:59:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔纳 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corre, Jonah! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.14,1:59:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.85,1:59:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是皮肉伤 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a flesh wound, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.41,1:59:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.62,1:59:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.37,1:59:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退 围住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back it up! Contain her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.07,2:00:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲在我身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get behind me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.63,2:00:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把药全用上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took all the medicine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.01,2:00:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,药效就快退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's wearing off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:59.00,2:01:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你朋友那儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.58,2:01:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.09,2:01:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.21,2:01:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll know when.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.69,2:01:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,九点方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.98,2:01:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,绿色液体的药效快没了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That green juice is wearin' off, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.23,2:01:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来对于老变种人来说药效还真短\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for an old mute, it's kind of a short high.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.24,2:01:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你会连爪子都伸不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be hard to keep them claws out, soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.95,2:01:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭了这混蛋 罗根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waste this dick, Logan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.03,2:01:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,请住手 豪利特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stop, Mr. Howlett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.20,2:01:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就得下令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to tell these men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.33,2:01:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝孩子们开火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fire on these children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.54,2:01:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不想这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.04,2:01:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道血清的药效很快就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see the effects of the serum are wearing off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.54,2:01:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再受伤的话你就活不成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not survive further wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.38,2:01:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请允许我自我介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to introduce myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.30,2:01:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫桑德尔·莱斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Zander Rice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.47,2:01:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你应在X武器项目中见过我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you knew my father on the Weapon X Program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.72,2:01:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是那个混蛋把毒药注入我体内的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He's the asshole who put this poison in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.31,2:01:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 混蛋之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he was one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.18,2:02:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他应该已经被我杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I might have killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.27,2:02:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.48,2:02:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,放尊重些 变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you show some respect, mutie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.06,2:02:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你眼前的这位可是消灭了所有变种人的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lookin' at the man who wiped out your kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.61,2:02:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友唐纳德言过其实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend Donald overstates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.57,2:02:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把事情说得过分残忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes it sound more brutal than intended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.45,2:02:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的目的不是消灭变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The goal was not to end mutant kind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.87,2:02:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是掌控他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.29,2:02:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reahzed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.50,2:02:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该放弃在饮食上的研发\N{\fnArial\fs30}we needn't stop perfecting what we eat and drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.17,2:02:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用这些产品来完善自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we could use those products to perfect ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.42,2:02:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,从饮料到谷物早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}To distribute gene therapy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.80,2:02:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在每样东西中\N{\fnArial\fs30}discreetly through everything…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.30,2:02:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨慎地进行基因治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}from sweet drinks to breakfast cereals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.67,2:02:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it worked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.97,2:02:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,随机出现的变种基因 就像小儿麻痹一样被扼杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Random mutancy went the way of polio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.64,2:02:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们开始了下一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}We embarked on our next endeavor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.14,2:02:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,培育你们自己的变种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Growing mutants of your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.93,2:02:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正是 - 世道艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Precisely. - Dangerous times, James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.02,2:02:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,世道艰难 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.04,2:03:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你上场了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime, boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:38.74,2:03:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 小子 起来 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, go! Get up, boy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.54,2:03:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他杀的 快起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did that. Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.10,2:04:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.81,2:04:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.28,2:04:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.74,2:05:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.57,2:05:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.12,2:05:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.58,2:05:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.79,2:05:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 离开这儿 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Get out of here! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.71,2:05:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.74,2:06:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.88,2:06:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.30,2:06:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.55,2:06:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.39,2:06:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.51,2:06:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.91,2:07:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,带上你的朋友 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your friends, and run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.79,2:07:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.71,2:07:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 他们还会派人来追杀你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run. They'll keep coming and coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.50,2:07:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你们不必再战斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you don't have to fight anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.43,2:07:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.06,2:07:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别成为他们所希望的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be what they made you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.11,2:07:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,劳拉 劳拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laura… Laura…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.74,2:07:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:01.34,2:08:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来 死亡是这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is what it feels like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:08.27,2:08:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No;{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.89,2:08:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.57,2:08:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.41,2:08:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.32,2:09:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,人必须忠于自己 乔伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A man has to be what he is, Joey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.53,2:09:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能违背自己的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Can't break the mold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.08,2:09:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,带着杀戮活下去很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There's no living with a killing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.71,2:09:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路没有退路\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There's no going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.79,2:09:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是对是错 你都得背负\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Right or wrong, it's a brand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.55,2:09:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,直至一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A brand that sticks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.51,2:09:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在快回去找你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Now you run on home to your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.05,2:09:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉她一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You tell her everything's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.10,2:09:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,山谷里再也不会有枪声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There are no more guns in the valley."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.29,2:10:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 继续上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. We gotta move.{\r}
